<title>USA: Philippines seeks about 11,000 T U.S. rice.</title>
<headline>Philippines seeks about 11,000 T U.S. rice.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philippines will seek about 11,000 tonnes, five percent less at buyer's option, U.S. No.2 or better long grain or medium grain milled rice under the PL 480 export program, its U.S. export agent said.</p>
<p>Rice is to be available FAS (free along side) for December 10-31 shipment.</p>
<p>Bids must be submitted no later than September 19.</p>
<p>--Doris Frankel 312-983-7305</p>
